    <briefdescription>
<para>base class for components having a reset </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class forms a reset domain which is a set of components (sc_modules) having the same reset. sc_modules using sc_registers should inherit from this class as well so that all registers get the respective reset. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
